5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry the ground might surprise us again.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Pretty plans are cheap; maintenance is where the money goes.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’d like to see how the last projects are holding up.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Who actually shows up to water the plants on a Tuesday?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let’s not pick a design that fights the rain.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, do you think the old works are still okay?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, if the staff is thin, the budget balloons.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Yes, the drawings look fine, but the reality is different.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I need to know the staffing levels before I commit.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Agreed. The ground doesn’t care about our aesthetic preferences.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I want to check who is digging and when.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll look at the upkeep costs per hectare.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will review the condition of the earlier programme.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I need the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the drainage records and the heat readings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,It feels important to know the timeline risks.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,Exactly. The ribbon cutting is the easy part.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I hope we find something that lasts, not just looks good.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I am anxious about the long-term care burden.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"We need data, not just vibes. Let’s see what the ground says.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
