35,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The firms say the clay is tricky, but they can dig.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"@Victoria, the roll is down to seven. That’s a problem.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The old basin is fine, but the apron is failing.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@May, I found two volunteer groups already working weekends.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The drainage data is ugly. The culvert is clogged.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, does the clog mean we can’t build?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, volunteers help, but they don’t mow the turf.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,The apron failure suggests the soil prep was rushed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"The volunteers handle habitat and youth sports, not daily upkeep.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It means we need a bigger pipe, not a smaller pond.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I’m glad the basin is still holding.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The bought-in services are expensive. We need to cut the green.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with May. Less lawn, more hard surface.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"If we cut the lawn, the volunteers have less to do.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The crossing counts show people want a path, not a meadow.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,A path seems safer for the kids.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,A path is cheaper to keep than a meadow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,A path is honest. It doesn’t pretend to be a forest.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,A path is what the volunteers can actually maintain.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,A path is what the ground can actually support.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
