60,3,1,talk,Minato,,The clay worries me for the wetland.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,May,,The wetland will cost a fortune to maintain.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shizue,,The wetland is the only one that respects the ground.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The wetland needs constant monitoring. Who does that?,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,The wetland is the only one that fixes the drainage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
