67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,The budget is a choice. The ground is a fact.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"The volunteers can help with the reeds, not the pumps.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
