70,3,3,talk,Minato,,I like the boardwalks. They feel safe.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,May,,I hate the cost. But I hate the lawn more.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,The boardwalks are honest. They admit the ground is wet.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
