75,3,4,talk,Minato,,I think the wetland is the right choice.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,May,,I think the wetland is the only choice that lasts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
